            Start with the project. Penofin Blue Label is the most versatile choice for siding, fences and trim, TWP 1500 suits large softwood jobs, Cabot Australian Timber Oil and TotalBoat Danish Teak Sealer handle dense hardwoods, Sashco Transformation belongs on log homes, and Seal-Once Marine fits docks. Thompson's is the low-cost option for sheds and utility wood.
          </p>
